<span>✓ DocManFu is ready at http://localhost:8080</span></code></pre></div><div class="reveal delay-1"><p class="eyebrow">Open by design</p><h2>Inspect it. Improve it. Make it yours.</h2><p>DocManFu is MIT licensed and built in the open with FastAPI, Svelte, PostgreSQL, Redis, Celery, and Docker. No proprietary export format. No hostage negotiation with your own data.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button button-primary" href="{{ site.github }}">Explore the code</a><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.github }}/issues">Join the project <span>↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>

